   "source": [
    "# Generic MCP Tool Call Template\n",
    "\n",
    "The SQL cell below only exists so this demo has an MCP server to talk to (a Databricks UC function). **Skip it when using another server such as Essbase.** The call cell works with any MCP server over Streamable HTTP. Change only `MCP_URL`, `HEADERS`, `TOOL_NAME` and `TOOL_ARGS`."
   ]
